-- The Bride v2 · red, yellow and black only. No cream. Fan concept, not for sale.
create a card called the-bride-v9 from stainless, seed 1973.

sign "The Bride" called signature-front, at 620 1678, 520 wide, size 140, tilted 0.
sign "The Bride" called signature-back, at 620 1678, 520 wide, size 140, tilted 0.


define a katana with $size 600 as:
  draw a shape called blade from $size * 0 $size * -0.02 to $size * 0.35 $size * -0.03 to $size * 0.65 $size * -0.042 to $size * 0.86 $size * -0.06 to $size * 0.67 $size * -0.012 to $size * 0.35 $size * 0.004 to $size * 0 $size * 0.02.
  draw a line called shinogi from $size * 0.03 $size * -0.013 to $size * 0.35 $size * -0.021 to $size * 0.65 $size * -0.031 to $size * 0.83 $size * -0.052, $size * 0.004 wide.
  draw a line called edge from $size * 0.02 $size * 0.017 to $size * 0.35 $size * 0.002 to $size * 0.66 $size * -0.011 to $size * 0.85 $size * -0.057, $size * 0.005 wide.
  draw a curve called hamon from $size * 0.05 $size * 0.0046 through $size * 0.108 $size * 0.0089 through $size * 0.166 $size * 0.0013 through $size * 0.224 $size * 0.0056 through $size * 0.282 $size * -0.002 through $size * 0.34 $size * 0.0023 through $size * 0.398 $size * -0.0053 through $size * 0.456 $size * -0.001 through $size * 0.514 $size * -0.0086 through $size * 0.572 $size * -0.0043 through $size * 0.63 $size * -0.012 through $size * 0.688 $size * -0.0076 through $size * 0.746 $size * -0.0153, $size * 0.003 wide.
  draw a rectangle called habaki, $size * 0.03 by $size * 0.05, at $size * 0.018 0.
  draw an ellipse called guard, $size * 0.042 by $size * 0.15, at $size * -0.014 0.
  draw an ellipse called guard-ring, $size * 0.026 by $size * 0.11, at $size * -0.014 0, hollow, $size * 0.004 wide.
  draw a rectangle called grip, $size * 0.26 by $size * 0.05, corners $size * 0.01, at $size * -0.167 0.
  draw a rectangle called wrap, $size * 0.026 by $size * 0.026, at $size * -0.277 0.
  turn the wrap 45 degrees in place.
  copy the wrap 6 times, $size * 0.043 apart.
  draw a circle called pommel, $size * 0.026 big, at $size * -0.312 0.
  draw a curve called blood from $size * 0.8 $size * -0.05 through $size * 0.68 $size * -0.03 through $size * 0.56 $size * -0.02 through $size * 0.46 $size * -0.008 to $size * 0.4 $size * 0.0, $size * 0.012 wide.
  draw a circle called drip, $size * 0.011 big, at $size * 0.34 $size * 0.006.
  copy the drip, by $size * 0.14 $size * -0.01, called drip-2.
  copy the drip, by $size * 0.27 $size * -0.022, called drip-3.
  draw a star called splat, 9 points, $size * 0.03 big, $size * 0.013 inner, at $size * 0.6 $size * -0.01.
end.


make the window 826 by 1415, at 207 207.

-- the bezel: a thick red frame with a black line inside it
draw a rectangle called inner-line, 826 by 1415, corners 8, hollow, 12 wide, at 620 914.


-- the back checker
draw a rectangle called squares, 40 by 40, at 100 100.
copy the squares 14 times, 80 apart.
copy the squares 21 times, 80 apart, down.
copy the squares, by 40 40, called squares-2.

on the front.
enamel the card in red.
print @front-art.jpg in the window.
enamel the inner-line in black.
outline the signature-front in black, 4 wide.
enamel the signature-front in #e69d27.

on the back.
enamel the card in red.
enamel the window in #e69d27.
enamel the squares within the window in red.
enamel the squares-2 within the window in black.
print @back-art.jpg in the window.
enamel the inner-line in black.
outline the signature-back in black, 4 wide.
enamel the signature-back in #e69d27.
